0,Nilotic languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nilotic_languages,"These Nilotic languages' groupings are geographical classifications rather than mutual intelligibility. For instance, the Dinka is a different language from the Luo, which is also different from Nuer etc.Nilo-Saharan branches.","Dinka, Southeastern",Nilo-Saharan
